        "original_id": "dcb557b6-df78-5831-a692-7d5072be8662",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ralph Smart, Trey Parker, Anthony Bushell\n- Works: Danger Man, Quatermass and the Pit\n- Roles: producer, director, writer, actor, animator, singer, songwriter\n\nFacts:\n- Ralph Smart was born on 27 August 1908 and died on 12 February 2001.\n- Ralph Smart was a film and television producer, director, and writer born in England to Australian parents.\n- Anthony Bushell played Colonel Breen in the BBC serial Quatermass and the Pit from 1958 to 1959.\n- Ralph Smart created the television programme Danger Man and wrote many of its scripts.\n- Anthony Bushell appeared in and directed the British TV series Danger Man.\n- Trey Parker, born Randolph Severn \"Trey\" Parker III on October 19, 1969, is an American actor, animator, writer, director, producer, singer, and songwriter.",
